    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Lassa epidemiology\"\nsubtitle: \"Case burden, reporting and the limits of the sampling record\"\ndescription: \"How many Lassa fever cases there really are, and what the surveillance and sequence record can support.\"\ncategories: [Lassa Fever, Epidemiology]\ntoc: true\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n\n::: {.callout-note appearance=\"minimal\"}\nPlaceholder page. The framing text is a draft. The explainer notes for the\nunder-reporting and sequencing-bias papers are written and will be pulled in\nfrom `data/paper_notes/` when the programme pages are wired to the\npublications data.\n:::\n\nReported Lassa fever case counts are the input to almost every risk model, and\nthey are incomplete in ways that vary by country and by year. This programme\nasks what can be inferred anyway.\n\n## Detections in hosts\n\nRecords of *Mammarenavirus lassaense* detected in small mammals across West\nAfrica, drawn from the Project ArHa database. The assay vocabulary is being\nreconciled, so some findings currently appear twice.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-condensed\" style=\"font-size: 10px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<caption style=\"font-size: initial !important;\">Comprehensive list of Mammarenavirus lassaense findings in hosts across West Africa.</caption>\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:right;\"> Year </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Country </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Species </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> Assay </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:left;\"> References </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr grouplength=\"8\"><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid;\"><strong>Mastomys</strong></td></tr>\n<tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:right;padding-left: 2em;\" indentlevel=\"1\"> 2014 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;\"> Guinea </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:left;\"